anese cuisine","cuisine/javanese-cuisine",[["Nasi gandul","dish/nasi-gandul"]]]]},{"h":"Often cooked with","links":[["Chili pepper","ingredient/chili-pepper"],["Ginger","ingredient/ginger"],["Candlenut","ingredient/candlenut"],["Coconut milk","ingredient/coconut-milk"],["Galangal","ingredient/galangal"],["Sugar","ingredient/sugar"],["Lemongrass","ingredient/lemongrass"],["Coriander","ingredient/coriander"],["Garlic","ingredient/garlic"],["Cucumber","ingredient/cucumber"],["Holy basil","ingredient/holy-basil"],["Krupuk","ingredient/krupuk"],["Mung bean sprout","ingredient/mung-bean-sprout"],["Shrimp paste","ingredient/shrimp-paste"],["Chicken","ingredient/chicken"],["Seedling","ingredient/seedling"]]}],"img":{"src":"/world-cuisine/img/thumb/9/9a/Galangal.web.jpg/500px-Galangal.web.jpg","w":500,"h":802,"by":"Unknown author","lic":"Public domain","licUrl":"","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Galangal.web.jpg"}},"dish/campanile-cake":{"t":"dish","r":"dish/campanile-cake","n":"Campanile (cake)","c":"#ede6da","crumb":[["Dishes","dishes"]],"sub":"Dish from Corsican cuisine","dot":"#cf5f87","intro":[["Campanile, meaning \"the bell tower\", pl. campanili) is a Corsican cake generally shaped like a crown, made of yeast dough. It is a typical dessert of the cuisine of Corsica and is a traditional Easter cake: the boiled eggs in the cake look like little bells inside the bell tower and represent the renewed fertility of the earth after the end of winter, remembering also the tradition to unleash the bells at Easter, after having tethered them at Good Friday."]],"src":"wikipedia","actions":[{"kind":"globe","hash":"dish-campanile-cake"},{"kind":"wiki","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Campanile_(cake)"}],"sections":[{"h":"Where it's from","links":[["Corsican cuisine","cuisine/corsican-cuisine"]]}]},"dish/dahi-vada":{"t":"dish","r":"dish/dahi-vada","n":"Dahi vada","c":"#ede6da","crumb":[["Dishes","dishes"]],"sub":"Dish from Indian cuisine","dot":"#f0b340","intro":